Package: grim
Version: @DEB_GRIM_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://sr.ht/~emersion/grim/
Depends: libwayland0, libpixman-1-0, libpng16-16, libjpeg62-turbo
Description: Grab images from a Wayland compositor
 grim is a command-line screenshot utility for Wayland. It captures output
 pixels through the wlr-screencopy protocol into a wl_shm buffer and writes
 PNG, JPEG, or PPM. Pairs with slurp for region selection. Runs as a native
 Wayland client under the iosc compositor (requires the compositor to
 implement zwlr_screencopy_manager_v1 frame delivery).
